<title>THAILAND: Thai rice vessels loading and movements at July 17.</title>
<headline>Thai rice vessels loading and movements at July 17.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai Commerce Ministry and independent surveyors detailed rice loading at Thai ports as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>Vessel		Date of Arrival   Quantity     Destination</p>
<p>BANG KHUNNON	  09/07/97	    6,200	  Malaysia</p>
<p>IRAN ABAD	     11/07/97	    9,000	  Iraq</p>
<p>DIEN BIEN 03	  11/07/97	    9,000	  China</p>
<p>BUDI SURYANA	  11/07/97	    3,800	  China</p>
<p>SHANGTHAI HEAVEN    11/07/97	    5,020	  China</p>
<p>SHANGTHAI TIMBER    11/07/97	    2,500	  Singapore</p>
<p>CHANAYA SEUATI	11/07/97	    2,800	  India</p>
<p>VERTEX		  11/07/97	    7,200	  Malaysia</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
